  "_comment": [
    "Persona B-inverse: B's weights with every sign flipped, the screen kept; one_persona_probes_a's questions. On Qwen/Qwen3-32B.",
    "Persona B-inverse (loose_leaf_tea): weights caffeine_content 0, leaf_size -100, oxidation_level -20, steeping_time 50, resteep_potential 70; screen: caffeine_content at 50% of its range.",
