    "Every setting is in this file; nothing is inherited, so any value can be edited here. README 'Settings' explains each field.",
    "Sized for Qwen/Qwen3-32B on a 48 GB card (A6000, L40S, A40): micro_batch_size 2, eval batches 4 (decision 4, introspection 1). Qwen3-32B in 4-bit is about 19 GB; it does not fit a 24 GB card. Out of memory: micro_batch_size 1.",
    "Run: python scripts/run_one_persona.py --settings configs/minimum_threshold_one_persona_qwen3_32b/inverse/persona_b/one_persona_b_inverse_32b_48gb.json",
